cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Open3DJ in research, teaching, a publication or a product,
  please cite the software using the metadata in this file. Thank you for
  helping the project and its contributors get credit.
title: Open3DJ
type: software
abstract: >-
  Open3DJ is open-source, agent-first, local-first CAD created by Neural
  Deep Network LTD. It provides precise parametric B-rep modeling that AI
  agents drive over MCP and a CLI, a professional desktop user interface
  for Windows, macOS and Linux, local compute with pluggable cloud GPUs, and
  an industrial product design pipeline from brief and concept to design
  for manufacture and supplier handoff.
authors:
  - name: Neural Deep Network LTD
    website: "https://www.neuraldeep.net"
  - name: The Open3DJ contributors
repository-code: "https://github.com/NeuralDEEPnet/Open3DJ"
url: "https://github.com/NeuralDEEPnet/Open3DJ"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - CAD
  - computer-aided design
  - agentic AI
  - AI agents
  - Model Context Protocol
  - MCP
  - parametric modeling
  - B-rep
  - Open CASCADE
